eed: 300Gain: B-gain ±30 dB Dynamic Range: 40 dB-90 dB AGC: 4 steps FAM (Free Angular M-mode) Auto-optimizer (Optimization of gain) - Spectral Doppler Display: Power spectrum Real-time Doppler Auto Trace Doppler methods: - PW (Pulsed Wave) Doppler - HPRF (High Pulse Repetition Frequency) PW Doppler - Dual Gate Doppler - CW (Continuous Wave) Doppler (Optional) Doppler gain: 60dB variable, adjustable in real-time and frozen. Dynamic Range: 40-90dB 1dB steps (changeable after freezing) Black-and-white inversion: changeable after freezing Auto-Optimizer(Optimization of gain, velocity range and baseline shift ) CW auto noise reduction Adaptive Noise Rejection) - Color Flow Mapping Color area size: Variable from 100% to 25% continuously Steered linear scanning: Max. ±30 degrees *, changeable at 5 degrees interval * Probe dependent Line density: Up to 8 steps Auto-Optimizer (Optimization of gain) - PowerFlow : Display patterns: PowerFlow, Directional PowerFlow eFLOW, Display patterns: eFLOW, Directional eFLOW, Advanced wall motion reduction , TDI (Tissue Doppler Imaging) Yes, optional - Cine Memory Cine search and loop display (in B mode): Capacity B mode: Max. 78,835 frames.M and D modes: Max. approx. 900 seconds. - Format DICOM Optional/ (Raw, MJPEG) (Non-compressed, RLE, RGB(Plane/Pixel), JPEG) - Image acquisition mode, Cine loop high-speed data transfer (Raw, Image):It is possible to selectively store data of arbitrary section in the Cine Memory.Simultaneous output to multiple media: It is possible to output still image data to multiple of storage media include network and printers at the touch of a button. - Measurement data It is possible to store measurement data in the main unit hard disk - Data storage media • Main unit hard disk 500 GB HDD (Image Storage) & 128 GB SSD (Run OS and Software) • USB memory • USB HDD • Network interface(DICOM format): 10 BASE/T or 100 BASE/TX, (automatically switched) - DICOM network communication*1 DICOM Print/Storage/MW Measurements and Analysis , Basic measurements , B-mode image Yes – All, On M-mode image Yes – All, On spectral Doppler Yes – All, On B/D mode Yes – All - Application measurements - Obstetrical measurements & calculations (Yes) - Gynecological measurements & calculations (Yes) - Small parts measurements & calculations (Yes- All ) - General measurements available Abdominal measurements & calculations (Yes- All ) - General measurements available Report Functions (Yes- SR (basic)) - Hot Key function (Yes) - Measurements on VCR playback image Possible (manual calibration) - User’s calculation 30 equations can be set for each application User-assignable terms: 60 words possible - Font size of measurement result (Yes- Adjustable) - Preset Function 100 kinds - Characters and graphic displays Annotation & Body Marks - Menu control 10.1-inch color TFT LCD touch panel - Active Probe Port For electronic scanning probes: 4 active - Input/Output Signals (Yes) - Viewing Monitor · 21.5-inch LCD display · Tilt and swivel are possible. · Height adjustment and swivel together with operation panel - Environmental Requirements In Operation: · Temperature: +10 to +40 degrees C · Relative Humidity: 30 to 75% (non condensing) · Atmospheric pressure: 700 to 1060 hPa - Power Requirement 100 to 120/ 200 to 240V ±10%, 50 or 60 Hz, - Max. 900 VA (with optional recorders connected) Max. 580 VA (main unit only) - Dimensions 53.3 cm (W) × 74.2 cm (D) × 126.5 - 163.5cm (H) - Weight 85kg or less (main unit only) - Membawa tekhnology mutakhir/ terbaru yg tidak dimiliki oleh merek yg lain. - Ada guiding puncture yang memiliki akurasi tinggi ke sasaran baik untuk pcnl maupun biopsi. - ⁠memiliki probe konvek lubang dg 3 kemiringan yg terkontrol 0⁰, 15⁰ dan 30⁰. - Memiliki probe linier dg garis guiding linier sepanjang sisi probe. - Memiliki probe robotik laparaskopi.. yg bisa dipakai intraabdomen langsung - Memiliki teknology fusion guiding.. yg menyandingkan hasil ct scan real time tracking - Penggunaan sangat mudah karena panel touchscreen dg tombol yg sangat sederhana dg kemiringan panel 45⁰ yg sangat mempermudah operator baik bedah urology, bedah umum, bedah digestive, kandungan maupun untuk tindakan intervesi pain oleh sejawat anastesi, sejawat syaraf maupun rehab medik. - Memiliki teknology microdoppler usg yg dimerk lain masih doppler usg makro.. penting untuk menghindari pembuluh darah saat puncture batu atau biopsi tumor - ⁠Mempunyai 3 probe (multi fungsi).. baik probe transrectal, probe konvek dg lubang puncture, dan probe linier dg guiding puncture linier sepanjang tepi probe + 1 probe optional (probe robotik laparaskopi)', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 425232);
